Assumptions and Defaults
Default for missing collision_mode is None (per your selection), so maps must explicitly mark colliding layers.
One-way platform behavior is top-contact-only; underside collisions are intentionally ignored.
Drop-through input is DOWN + JUMP.
Object-layer (objectgroup) collisions remain out of scope for this pass.
No changes to transition JSON schema or collision broadphase complexity.
